WEBVTT

01:29.700 --> 01:31.620
[Blood River]

01:31.620 --> 01:33.980
[Based on the novel of the same name from Zhou Munan's Youth in Jianghu series]

01:33.980 --> 01:35.980
[Available on fanqienovel.com & bkneng.com]

01:36.340 --> 01:39.020
[Episode 38]

02:18.190 --> 02:19.610
Floral Sword Art!

03:09.560 --> 03:11.170
You were a good archer.

03:12.590 --> 03:13.980
Instead of training on

03:14.590 --> 03:15.100
the battlefield

03:15.280 --> 03:17.290
and developing your abilities,

03:19.150 --> 03:21.780
you just had to go for a despicable job like being an assassin.

03:23.710 --> 03:25.060
You brought this upon yourself.

03:36.430 --> 03:37.220
Take this.

04:03.030 --> 04:03.610
You're here.

04:06.430 --> 04:07.060
I'm here.

04:08.150 --> 04:09.010
I'm here to rescue you.

04:13.710 --> 04:14.610
Didn't you say

04:15.680 --> 04:17.140
my life and death have nothing to do with you?

04:18.070 --> 04:18.930
Didn't you say

04:18.950 --> 04:20.410
that you weren't willing to get involved with Tianqi City?

04:21.430 --> 04:22.170
Stop bossing me around.

04:22.750 --> 04:23.610
I can come whenever I like.

04:28.830 --> 04:29.610
Back then,

04:30.480 --> 04:31.540
on the night we infiltrated

04:31.560 --> 04:32.540
Tai'an Palace,

04:33.160 --> 04:34.700
it was much more perilous than today.

04:36.430 --> 04:37.170
Even so,

04:37.920 --> 04:39.370
you didn't come to Tianqi.

04:41.680 --> 04:42.370
That night,

04:45.510 --> 04:46.900
I was already in Tianqi City.

04:52.390 --> 04:54.660
I planted some spies within your ranks.

04:55.390 --> 04:56.490
Whenever you were in danger,

04:56.830 --> 04:57.780
he would fire a signal arrow.

04:58.510 --> 04:59.520
And then, I'd take my sword

04:59.600 --> 05:00.540
and storm the palace.

05:01.920 --> 05:03.020
I don't care if it's King Qing,

05:03.270 --> 05:04.020
King Jingyu,

05:04.480 --> 05:05.100
or even Emperor Tai'an.

05:06.070 --> 05:07.340
If I take my sword with me,

05:08.510 --> 05:09.730
you have to come with me by hook or by crook.

05:15.600 --> 05:16.250
Let's cut our conversation short.

05:18.480 --> 05:20.020
As night slowly rises,

05:20.800 --> 05:22.100
the wind drifts away in parting.

05:39.430 --> 05:39.980
Ms. Yumo.

05:40.240 --> 05:40.780
You're awake.

05:47.190 --> 05:47.870
She's fine now.

05:47.950 --> 05:49.170
Xuanwu Guardian, you may come in.

06:03.480 --> 06:04.460
The last time

06:04.920 --> 06:06.370
I sustained such a serious injury,

06:08.310 --> 06:09.850
it was because of you.

06:11.000 --> 06:11.810
Back then,

06:13.240 --> 06:15.340
you weren't this anxious.

06:16.430 --> 06:16.850
I...

06:18.160 --> 06:19.050
What?

06:20.600 --> 06:21.780
Sit down and speak.

06:34.430 --> 06:36.700
You're still as tight-lipped as ever.

06:38.680 --> 06:40.370
In the past, I used to hate you

06:41.000 --> 06:42.540
for being a silent gourd.

06:43.600 --> 06:45.170
But now, I realized something.

06:46.920 --> 06:48.250
When you fancy a person,

06:49.630 --> 06:50.540
even when you don't speak,

06:52.070 --> 06:53.220
you can express your feelings through your actions

06:54.160 --> 06:55.540
and expressions.

07:01.560 --> 07:02.900
After this encounter,

07:03.510 --> 07:04.740
I finally confirmed

07:04.740 --> 07:05.850
your feelings for me.

07:09.750 --> 07:10.700
Now that I think about it,

07:12.360 --> 07:14.660
I actually won the heart of the mighty Xuanwu Guardian.

07:16.270 --> 07:17.700
I can die without regrets now.

07:18.600 --> 07:19.410
You won't die.

07:19.870 --> 07:20.580
I won't allow you to die.

07:29.270 --> 07:30.540
Our trip to Tianqi

07:32.040 --> 07:33.170
has made us more aware

07:34.310 --> 07:36.050
of the responsibility we bear.

07:37.950 --> 07:38.660
Tang Lianyue,

07:40.390 --> 07:41.700
let's make another promise.

07:46.000 --> 07:47.900
When you and I have completed all of our missions,

07:49.560 --> 07:50.850
when you're no longer the Xuanwu Guardian,

07:52.240 --> 07:53.540
when I'm no longer an assassin of Blood River,

07:54.720 --> 07:56.220
when we're merely Tang Lianyue

07:57.750 --> 07:59.050
and Mu Yumo,

08:01.870 --> 08:02.780
by then,

08:04.360 --> 08:05.780
we can fancy each other

08:06.950 --> 08:07.780
all we like.

08:09.390 --> 08:10.410
We can go to wherever

08:11.630 --> 08:12.490
we want to go.

08:15.500 --> 08:19.980
♪Thoughts that never fade, year after year gazing from afar♪

08:24.870 --> 08:25.290
All right.

08:26.920 --> 08:27.490
I promise.

08:30.510 --> 08:32.250
I'll wait until His Highness has finished what he set out to do.

08:35.360 --> 08:36.700
After that, I'll follow in Sikong Changfeng's footsteps.

08:38.240 --> 08:39.530
I'll cast away the shackles of this city

08:40.910 --> 08:41.420
and look for you.

08:43.380 --> 08:48.340
♪May this life leave no regrets♪

08:52.630 --> 08:53.180
You should go.

08:54.270 --> 08:55.530
Both Tianqi City and Prince of Langya

08:56.480 --> 08:57.220
need you.

09:00.060 --> 09:06.420
♪When we meet again, may our first glance be as it was before♪…♪

09:06.440 --> 09:06.980
Go now.

09:07.820 --> 09:15.260
♪Ask not of joy or sorrow in this world, speak only of our heart’s desire♪

09:15.300 --> 09:22.540
♪Hear the free wind’s song, hear the snow fall upon my battle robes…♪

09:24.840 --> 09:25.700
During our first encounter,

09:26.440 --> 09:27.420
I broke your mask.

09:29.120 --> 09:30.180
I always wanted to compensate you with another one.

09:31.320 --> 09:32.770
But I could never find the opportunity to do so.

09:34.600 --> 09:35.060
And...

09:35.700 --> 09:40.980
♪Whose longing guards this land unharmed?♪

09:41.100 --> 09:46.500
♪You are well, just as you were at the start♪

09:46.510 --> 09:47.250
And what?

09:49.790 --> 09:51.180
I don't want you to put on a mask again.

09:53.030 --> 09:54.940
I don't want you to hide your identity again.

09:57.000 --> 09:57.650
I hope

09:59.270 --> 10:00.730
you can walk in the sunlight freely.

10:15.140 --> 10:22.980
♪Sing me a farewell tune, and smile as time goes on unchanged...♪

10:24.270 --> 10:25.180
Did you make this yourself?

10:27.080 --> 10:27.460
Yes, I did.

10:31.360 --> 10:32.100
You're quite skilled.

10:42.270 --> 10:42.850
Hurry and go.

10:45.980 --> 10:50.460
♪Thoughts that never fade, year after year gazing from afar♪

10:50.500 --> 10:55.860
♪Whose longing guards this land unharmed?♪

10:55.900 --> 11:01.420
♪You are well, just as you were at the start♪

11:01.620 --> 11:08.580
♪Bleeding for the faith I hold, I trade the world for skies of light…♪

11:11.600 --> 11:12.460
Xuanwu Guardian,

11:13.080 --> 11:15.100
I thought you cherished a beauty like me.

11:15.720 --> 11:16.820
That's why you couldn't bear to strike me down.

11:17.320 --> 11:18.180
Silly boy.

11:19.910 --> 11:20.980
I knew you were lying to me.

11:22.840 --> 11:24.180
I knew you were still concerned about me.

11:24.790 --> 11:25.490
Yue,

11:26.270 --> 11:27.530
it's getting late.

11:28.600 --> 11:29.420
Do you wish to rest?

11:31.240 --> 11:33.220
I haven't recovered completely.

11:33.910 --> 11:34.610
Why don't you feed me?

11:40.420 --> 11:45.500
♪Do not long for the sorrow of separation♪

11:45.780 --> 11:52.660
♪May this life leave no regrets♪

12:00.580 --> 12:02.900
[Flying Tiger General's Residence]

12:06.320 --> 12:07.130
Flying Tiger General,

12:07.840 --> 12:08.850
where are you going at this late hour?

12:09.550 --> 12:10.420
Xuanwu Guardian,

12:11.030 --> 12:11.730
shouldn't you be...

12:12.150 --> 12:12.820
Sorry about this.

12:13.910 --> 12:14.730
I've returned.

12:15.960 --> 12:17.220
I'm here to take your life.

12:17.630 --> 12:18.250
General Dian,

12:18.790 --> 12:20.490
please put down your weapons.

12:21.440 --> 12:22.580
You think you guys can take us down?

12:23.910 --> 12:24.370
General.

12:28.240 --> 12:29.850
It seems you guys have received the news as well.

12:30.480 --> 12:31.980
After Fengxi Manor was set on fire,

12:32.390 --> 12:32.940
the Inner Security Division

12:32.960 --> 12:34.180
took over it immediately.

12:34.870 --> 12:36.340
The noblemen's sons who you've kidnapped

12:36.600 --> 12:37.980
have been sent back to their residences.

12:38.790 --> 12:39.820
The forces behind them

12:40.600 --> 12:41.250
won't do anything

12:41.270 --> 12:42.420
tonight.

12:43.080 --> 12:43.770
As for you,

12:46.270 --> 12:48.130
it's time for you

12:48.600 --> 12:49.980
to pay the price.

13:04.360 --> 13:05.420
This is truly vexing.

13:12.580 --> 13:15.540
[Kind Heart, Skilled Hands]

13:16.510 --> 13:16.980
He's here.

13:18.030 --> 13:18.980
It's been four days.

13:19.960 --> 13:20.940
Guardian Lianyue, I hope you can

13:20.960 --> 13:21.730
give me a satisfying answer.

13:24.360 --> 13:24.890
Firstly,

13:26.440 --> 13:27.490
is Great Eunuch Zhuo Qing dead?

13:28.910 --> 13:30.460
I was sure that I'd wounded him seriously.

13:30.840 --> 13:32.490
But I think he's still barely surviving.

13:33.360 --> 13:34.770
Initially, I wanted to complete the job.

13:35.390 --> 13:36.770
But something cropped up.

13:37.440 --> 13:38.770
When I headed back to find him,

13:39.720 --> 13:40.980
his body was already missing.

13:41.840 --> 13:42.460
We speculate

13:43.320 --> 13:45.130
that Jin Xuan, his disciple, has taken his body with him.

13:46.000 --> 13:46.890
However, we couldn't be sure

13:47.840 --> 13:48.700
whether he was dead or alive.

13:50.150 --> 13:50.580
Forget it.

13:52.380 --> 13:53.320
All right. Here's the second question.

13:55.790 --> 13:57.700
First Prince Xiao Yong, the mastermind of everything,

13:58.600 --> 14:00.250
what kind of punishment will he receive?

14:01.080 --> 14:02.100
For the uprising in Tianqi that night,

14:03.320 --> 14:04.220
Dian Ye, the Flying Tiger General,

14:05.480 --> 14:06.730
has already confessed that he was behind everything.

14:10.750 --> 14:12.340
Will your emperor just let him off like that?

14:13.510 --> 14:14.300
Or,

14:15.750 --> 14:17.730
is Prince of Langya just a decoration?

14:18.120 --> 14:18.650
Of course not.

14:20.960 --> 14:21.820
Xiao Yong also knows

14:22.480 --> 14:23.220
that he cannot

14:23.870 --> 14:25.370
get out of this that easily.

14:26.150 --> 14:27.250
Therefore, he confessed by writing a petition.

14:27.870 --> 14:28.850
He said that he was partly responsible

14:29.080 --> 14:30.010
for Dian Ye's crimes.

14:30.480 --> 14:31.610
He was willing to be imprisoned in the Imperial Astronomical Bureau,

14:32.440 --> 14:33.420
give up on his title as a prince,

14:34.630 --> 14:35.580
and never involve himself in political strife again.

14:37.240 --> 14:37.820
Is...

14:39.120 --> 14:40.060
Is that all?

14:43.270 --> 14:43.980
What about Prince of Langya?

14:45.240 --> 14:46.420
Is he satisfied with this ending?

14:46.960 --> 14:47.610
His Highness wasn't satisfied at all.

14:48.910 --> 14:50.180
He submitted a memorial impeaching First Prince.

14:51.030 --> 14:52.100
And, he submitted evidence of

14:52.480 --> 14:53.490
First Prince's participation in the rebellion.

14:54.360 --> 14:55.220
But on the second day,

14:56.440 --> 14:57.820
His Majesty has already permitted Xiao Yong's request.

14:58.630 --> 14:59.530
His Highness wanted to seek an audience with His Majesty,

15:00.150 --> 15:00.940
but His Majesty refused it.

15:01.630 --> 15:03.420
Is the Dragonseal Scroll still nowhere to be found?

15:04.200 --> 15:04.580
That's right.

15:05.630 --> 15:07.420
It seems as if someone has retrieved it before us.

15:07.870 --> 15:08.890
The Inner Security Division will continue

15:09.510 --> 15:10.300
to investigate the case.

15:16.000 --> 15:16.490
Head back now.

15:18.550 --> 15:20.530
None of your answers was satisfying.

15:21.670 --> 15:23.060
Patriarch, what do you plan to do next?

15:23.720 --> 15:24.180
Me?

15:25.510 --> 15:26.850
We'll talk about it after Su Muyu regains consciousness.

15:27.550 --> 15:28.900
I'll heed his will once he wakes up.

15:29.360 --> 15:30.950
After all, he was the one who decided to come to Tianqi.

15:31.840 --> 15:32.700
If he doesn't regain consciousness,

15:34.080 --> 15:35.220
I'll unsheathe my sword and hunt them down.

15:37.840 --> 15:39.010
Xiao Yong will die.

15:40.030 --> 15:40.820
Prince of Langya

15:42.030 --> 15:42.850
will die as well.

15:46.030 --> 15:46.580
Go now.

16:09.080 --> 16:10.130
Was I too harsh

16:10.150 --> 16:10.820
to your lover just now?

16:14.360 --> 16:15.490
You were gentler

16:16.910 --> 16:17.820
compared to your usual attitude.

16:18.910 --> 16:19.740
You went through

16:19.740 --> 16:21.250
a life-or-death situation with your beloved.

16:22.390 --> 16:23.820
Why does it feel like you're unhappy about it?

16:25.510 --> 16:26.850
Look at the current situation.

16:27.670 --> 16:29.470
How can I be happy about it?

16:34.120 --> 16:34.610
Yumo,

16:35.720 --> 16:36.420
right now,

16:37.390 --> 16:38.530
you're the only dependable member of the Mu family.

16:39.550 --> 16:40.100
I understand.

16:41.320 --> 16:42.060
From now on,

16:43.240 --> 16:44.220
I'm the head of Mu family.

16:46.720 --> 16:47.940
I'll set aside

16:49.270 --> 16:50.250
my feelings and relationships.

16:51.630 --> 16:52.340
Will you be able to achieve that?

16:54.150 --> 16:54.850
Don't worry.

16:56.080 --> 16:56.650
And,

16:57.720 --> 16:58.890
since he has already given me his promise,

17:00.360 --> 17:01.370
there's no need for me to be impatient.

17:04.590 --> 17:04.980
Go now.

18:09.310 --> 18:10.090
You're finally awake.

18:12.160 --> 18:12.570
She...

18:18.750 --> 18:19.660
White cranes fly south,

18:22.960 --> 18:23.860
gazing across the Huai River.

18:33.510 --> 18:34.730
Miss Bai didn't suffer

18:35.790 --> 18:36.770
during her last moments.

18:38.070 --> 18:39.570
Using my Inch Sword,

18:40.310 --> 18:40.730
Uncle Zhe, he...

18:47.030 --> 18:47.620
You know this too.

18:48.790 --> 18:49.980
Uncle Zhe always does a clean job.

18:51.270 --> 18:52.980
It already ended

18:52.980 --> 18:54.080
before Miss Bai felt anything.

18:54.790 --> 18:55.530
Uncle Zhe said

18:56.510 --> 18:57.900
that since you were unconscious,

18:59.830 --> 19:00.660
he had no choice

19:02.270 --> 19:03.330
but to do it on your behalf.

19:10.270 --> 19:11.330
They waited a few days for you,

19:12.310 --> 19:13.420
but you didn't regain consciousness.

19:16.070 --> 19:17.010
Therefore, Uncle Zhe will escort her body

19:17.070 --> 19:17.900
back to Medicine King Valley first.

19:20.960 --> 19:22.090
From now on, each Qingming,

19:23.270 --> 19:23.860
on the day of remembrance,

19:25.160 --> 19:26.330
they'll prepare a pot of wine for you

19:26.350 --> 19:27.220
in Medicine King Valley.

19:35.440 --> 19:36.050
They'll wait for you.

20:06.590 --> 20:07.250
Where's Night Crow?

20:08.920 --> 20:09.900
According to Yumo,

20:11.480 --> 20:12.620
she should've been reduced to ashes

20:12.640 --> 20:13.380
by Phoenix Descent.

20:15.960 --> 20:16.660
What about Xiao Yong?

20:20.200 --> 20:20.860
He confessed to his crimes.

20:22.200 --> 20:23.050
However, his father

20:23.070 --> 20:24.900
managed to keep him alive.

20:26.240 --> 20:27.900
He would only be imprisoned at the Imperial Astronomical Bureau.

20:29.510 --> 20:30.770
Prince of Langya asked us about the decision we would make.

20:32.550 --> 20:33.460
I said I would heed your will

20:34.510 --> 20:35.220
after you regain consciousness.

20:54.110 --> 20:54.530
Your Highness.

20:59.240 --> 20:59.900
Has Su Muyu

21:00.680 --> 21:01.330
regain consciousness?

21:03.510 --> 21:04.010
Not yet.

21:04.880 --> 21:05.940
I only met Su Changhe.

21:15.000 --> 21:16.290
What did the Patriarch of Blood River

21:17.440 --> 21:17.940
say?

21:20.200 --> 21:20.700
According to him,

21:21.510 --> 21:22.660
if Su Muyu regains consciousness,

21:23.550 --> 21:24.770
he will heed his will.

21:26.350 --> 21:27.620
If he doesn't regain consciousness,

21:28.400 --> 21:29.330
he'll kill Xiao Yong.

21:31.750 --> 21:32.290
He'll kill you as well.

22:01.070 --> 22:01.620
Perhaps

22:02.780 --> 22:04.250
my life will end before he hunts me down.

22:20.480 --> 22:21.490
Who are you?

22:21.920 --> 22:22.900
I came here to pay my final respects

22:23.720 --> 22:24.860
to the person behind you.

22:26.550 --> 22:27.050
Such audacity!

22:35.270 --> 22:36.090
Am I audacious?

22:37.640 --> 22:38.580
A good friend of mine

22:38.580 --> 22:39.870
rescued your son.

22:40.680 --> 22:41.810
But the person behind you

22:42.350 --> 22:43.730
took her life away.

22:46.960 --> 22:48.220
Shouldn't I come here to pay my final respects?

22:49.480 --> 22:50.490
So, it's you guys.

22:51.240 --> 22:52.420
But he has already confessed to his crime

22:52.440 --> 22:53.530
and will be sent to the Imperial Astronomical Bureau.

22:54.350 --> 22:56.290
His Majesty has already issued an imperial decree.

22:57.000 --> 22:58.180
His life now rests

22:58.920 --> 22:59.980
in the hands of Heaven.

23:01.310 --> 23:02.090
I am

23:03.110 --> 23:04.250
Heaven itself.

23:13.640 --> 23:15.530
Your Highness, are you planning to go into confinement?

23:17.960 --> 23:18.660
Master Su,

23:20.240 --> 23:21.290
you guys have already won.

23:22.240 --> 23:23.090
Prince of Langya and his men

23:23.880 --> 23:25.620
would surely keep his promise to you.

23:26.480 --> 23:27.420
They'll allow Blood River

23:28.270 --> 23:29.770
to walk in the sunlight.

23:31.960 --> 23:32.700
Why do you

23:34.070 --> 23:34.980
have to do this?

23:35.790 --> 23:36.620
So, a prince

23:36.640 --> 23:38.050
can kill at will, huh?

23:38.960 --> 23:40.900
Even if one has to accept punishment,

23:42.550 --> 23:44.420
they can survive

23:45.960 --> 23:47.810
as long as they give up on their title, huh?

23:50.070 --> 23:51.900
I haven't stepped into the Imperial Astronomical Bureau yet.

23:53.070 --> 23:54.660
I'm still a prince.

23:55.720 --> 23:56.380
Do you know

23:57.550 --> 23:59.000
what sort of crime it is

23:59.000 --> 24:00.330
to kill a prince on the streets?

24:01.480 --> 24:02.570
If you do so, Blood River

24:03.240 --> 24:04.530
will never be able

24:05.270 --> 24:07.220
to walk in the sunlight.

24:07.750 --> 24:09.090
A shadow will always remain one.

24:10.200 --> 24:12.140
It'll disappear when it makes contact with sunlight.

24:13.350 --> 24:14.380
You guys will become

24:14.510 --> 24:15.730
the most-wanted criminals of Beili.

24:16.440 --> 24:17.380
Each of your portraits

24:18.240 --> 24:19.810
will be posted

24:20.640 --> 24:22.980
at the most obvious spots of every city.

24:24.920 --> 24:26.530
When Qingyang and Xuewei died,

24:28.880 --> 24:30.290
Yumo asked me a question.

24:31.590 --> 24:32.570
Once,

24:34.400 --> 24:35.580
the death of our companions

24:35.580 --> 24:36.710
were nothing special

24:36.710 --> 24:38.140
to us.

24:41.270 --> 24:43.180
But now, everything has changed.

24:44.480 --> 24:45.660
How many people still have to die

24:47.920 --> 24:49.570
in order for us to reach the Other Shore?

24:55.480 --> 24:56.620
I have my own choice.

24:58.000 --> 24:58.730
That is to avenge Miss Bai,

25:00.000 --> 25:00.730
Qingyang,

25:01.110 --> 25:01.900
Xuewei,

25:03.240 --> 25:04.810
and every companion

25:04.830 --> 25:06.290
who was manipulated by you all.

25:16.880 --> 25:17.860
There's a certain meaning

25:18.510 --> 25:19.780
behind my choice.

25:20.790 --> 25:21.770
From now on,

25:22.440 --> 25:23.460
the entire Tianqi City

25:23.590 --> 25:25.570
will remember the name of Blood River.

25:28.270 --> 25:29.570
No one can manipulate us

25:29.590 --> 25:31.980
like pawns again.

25:33.880 --> 25:35.290
It's because they've already witnessed

25:36.550 --> 25:38.180
the price they have to pay for doing so.

26:14.880 --> 26:15.810
Darn it!

26:54.200 --> 26:54.660
What's the matter?

26:55.880 --> 26:57.380
Did you feel his presence as well?

27:06.680 --> 27:07.290
What are you looking at?

27:11.830 --> 27:12.290
Nothing.

27:28.240 --> 27:28.860
Su Yunxiu,

27:29.510 --> 27:30.490
how's my daughter doing?

27:31.030 --> 27:31.860
She's fine.

27:32.640 --> 27:33.290
Don't worry.

27:34.270 --> 27:35.250
Since I've stepped in,

27:35.920 --> 27:36.900
I'll save her no matter what.

27:37.110 --> 27:37.570
But,

27:38.400 --> 27:39.290
there's one condition.

27:39.720 --> 27:40.380
What is it?

27:40.960 --> 27:41.380
Tell me.

27:42.110 --> 27:43.770
I have to take the miracle physician with me for the time being.

27:45.480 --> 27:45.980
But why?

27:46.920 --> 27:48.010
I need to cultivate

27:48.880 --> 27:50.050
a martial art after this.

27:50.830 --> 27:52.420
I need another miracle physician to be on standby

27:52.510 --> 27:53.220
next to me.

27:53.830 --> 27:55.420
And, I don't want to be targeted by Su Muyu.

27:56.240 --> 27:57.980
It's very troublesome.

28:02.270 --> 28:03.290
You know my personality too.

28:04.640 --> 28:05.900
If you dare to utter a single word to him,

28:06.720 --> 28:07.380
Bai Hehuai

28:08.510 --> 28:09.980
will never return to your side again.

28:26.920 --> 28:27.530
Say,

28:27.960 --> 28:30.140
what will Su Muyu become in the future?

28:31.480 --> 28:32.860
This is truly intriguing.

28:34.590 --> 28:35.420
Right when

28:35.510 --> 28:37.010
he's about to step into the light,

28:38.640 --> 28:41.490
he's plunged into the dark abyss again.

28:51.110 --> 28:52.380
We're going to leave Tianqi City soon.

28:53.510 --> 28:54.770
We're here to bid you farewell, Prince of Langya.

28:57.880 --> 28:58.660
Perhaps you guys

28:59.720 --> 29:01.050
shouldn't have killed Xiao Yong.

29:01.880 --> 29:03.810
There are many ways to resolve the situation.

29:05.400 --> 29:06.380
But you guys just have to choose

29:07.160 --> 29:08.530
the one that's unsalvageable.

29:10.550 --> 29:11.980
Everyone says that I'm a lunatic.

29:12.960 --> 29:13.810
Actually,

29:15.640 --> 29:16.420
my buddy is the same.

29:19.110 --> 29:19.900
Your Highness,

29:21.030 --> 29:23.020
perhaps Blood River's Other Shore isn't

29:23.020 --> 29:23.980
what we expected it to be.

29:24.960 --> 29:25.980
What we wish to become

29:27.200 --> 29:28.810
are people who can stand beneath the light,

29:29.440 --> 29:31.460
not pawns meant for those fighting for power.

29:32.550 --> 29:34.090
If Xiao Yong was sent to the Imperial Astronomical Bureau,

29:34.790 --> 29:35.980
under the surveillance of

29:36.030 --> 29:36.810
Qi Tianchen, the Chancellor,

29:37.680 --> 29:38.980
it would be difficult for him to rise again.

29:40.440 --> 29:41.730
But now that Xiao Yong is dead,

29:42.720 --> 29:43.570
that'll complicate

29:44.070 --> 29:45.180
a lot of things.

29:45.960 --> 29:47.010
Perhaps in the past,

29:48.310 --> 29:49.940
Blood River stood in the shadows.

29:50.720 --> 29:51.700
Perhaps in the future,

29:52.400 --> 29:53.330
Blood River still isn't able

29:53.400 --> 29:54.700
to walk in the sunlight.

29:55.790 --> 29:56.980
But at the very least, right now,

29:57.680 --> 29:59.900
we carry with us a justice of our own.

30:00.880 --> 30:02.090
And, within that justice,

30:03.200 --> 30:04.460
Xiao Yong deserves to die.

30:08.640 --> 30:09.380
If anyone dares to use us

30:09.400 --> 30:10.570
as pawns again,

30:11.640 --> 30:13.530
don't blame us for rising up and taking control.

30:17.350 --> 30:18.900
Changhe and I will return to Blood River.

30:19.880 --> 30:21.900
From now on, we'll tread on our own path.

30:22.680 --> 30:23.810
We'll reach the Other Shore eventually,

30:27.160 --> 30:28.460
no matter how tough the journey will be.

30:31.790 --> 30:32.220
All right.

30:34.070 --> 30:36.570
If so, I hope that we won't be enemies

30:37.440 --> 30:38.290
the next time we meet.

30:40.400 --> 30:41.220
But it's difficult for us

30:42.880 --> 30:44.290
to become friends as well.

30:55.000 --> 30:55.490
Farewell.

31:19.270 --> 31:19.810
Chancellor,

31:20.440 --> 31:21.380
First Prince Xiao Yong

31:21.590 --> 31:22.770
was assassinated on his way

31:23.310 --> 31:24.180
to the Imperial Astronomical Bureau.

31:27.200 --> 31:28.380
Who did it?

31:28.750 --> 31:30.090
I only saw one of them before.

31:30.550 --> 31:32.010
Back then, he was outside our bureau.

31:32.480 --> 31:34.770
But you drove him off with your talisman.

31:41.480 --> 31:42.700
Perhaps

31:44.240 --> 31:45.660
I was too narrow-minded back then.

31:47.590 --> 31:49.460
The head of Su family

31:51.440 --> 31:53.980
is worth an encounter.

32:25.070 --> 32:25.530
What's the matter?

32:27.680 --> 32:28.330
Will you regret it?

32:33.590 --> 32:34.570
We put in so much effort for this.

32:35.750 --> 32:36.700
But everything went back to square one

32:40.920 --> 32:42.010
after you killed him.

32:45.270 --> 32:46.530
Prince of Langya won't be able to help us out.

32:47.790 --> 32:48.900
He's going to die soon.

32:50.400 --> 32:51.490
He wishes to pave a path

32:52.680 --> 32:54.530
for those he cared for before his death.

32:56.680 --> 32:58.330
But the people he cared for,

33:00.160 --> 33:01.140
the path they'll take

33:01.160 --> 33:02.730
is vastly different from ours.

33:05.270 --> 33:06.570
The turmoil of Tianqi City

33:08.400 --> 33:09.530
is just beginning.

33:10.830 --> 33:11.420
However,

33:12.480 --> 33:14.010
that has nothing to do with us for now.

33:15.340 --> 33:19.100
♪Between gain and loss, I cling to what won't fade♪

33:19.180 --> 33:23.020
♪Narrowly losing myself in the process♪

33:23.060 --> 33:29.980
♪Thank heaven this white world walks with the passing days♪

33:30.920 --> 33:31.860
Even in the polar hell,

33:33.680 --> 33:34.660
there is light to be seen.

33:34.740 --> 33:37.980
♪A fleeting breeze snuffs out the name I bore♪

33:42.160 --> 33:42.940
As the clouds drift away,

33:44.720 --> 33:45.570
the moon comes into view.

33:50.070 --> 33:51.530
The duo charge ahead

33:51.550 --> 33:52.770
following their momentum,

33:53.270 --> 33:55.220
as if the journey is never-ending.

33:55.640 --> 33:57.090
And, there's no turning back either.

33:57.590 --> 33:58.330
At that moment,

33:58.790 --> 34:01.530
it was eight years before Blood River

34:01.720 --> 34:03.420
returned to the martial world.

34:03.830 --> 34:05.060
And, it was 12 years

34:05.060 --> 34:06.800
before the reunion of Su Muyu

34:07.160 --> 34:09.460
and Bai Hehuai.

34:15.900 --> 34:19.380
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

34:19.420 --> 34:23.300
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

34:25.140 --> 34:28.620
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

34:28.660 --> 34:32.500
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

34:34.500 --> 34:37.780
♪Through joy and sorrow♪

34:37.900 --> 34:39.980
♪Still I can't let go♪

34:40.140 --> 34:43.580
♪Longing keeps me awake at night♪

34:44.060 --> 34:46.260
♪My heart no longer my own♪

34:46.380 --> 34:51.380
♪No one can escape from love♪

35:07.980 --> 35:11.700
♪How many hidden feelings♪

35:11.820 --> 35:15.900
♪Sink in silence deep?♪

35:17.140 --> 35:21.020
♪Searching through the endless nights♪

35:21.140 --> 35:25.380
♪Struggling on the edge of love and pain♪

35:26.500 --> 35:29.380
♪Shadows crossing shadows♪

35:29.460 --> 35:33.700
♪Whose name hides in your eyes?♪

35:35.980 --> 35:39.980
♪When the wind blows, ask not when I shall return♪

35:40.020 --> 35:43.460
♪Ask not when I shall return♪

35:44.980 --> 35:48.420
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

35:48.500 --> 35:52.300
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

35:54.220 --> 35:57.660
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

35:57.700 --> 36:01.540
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

36:03.580 --> 36:06.820
♪Through joy and sorrow♪

36:06.940 --> 36:09.020
♪Still I can't let go♪

36:09.220 --> 36:12.620
♪Longing keeps me awake at night♪

36:13.100 --> 36:15.300
♪My heart no longer my own♪

36:15.380 --> 36:20.420
♪No one can escape from love♪

36:27.780 --> 36:29.980
♪My heart no longer my own♪

36:30.060 --> 36:35.100
♪No one can escape from love♪

36:46.340 --> 36:49.700
[12 Years Later]

36:53.860 --> 36:57.020
[Grave of Beloved Daughter, Bai Hehuai]

37:07.340 --> 37:14.380
♪As mountain rains draw near, they scatter blooms into the mire…♪

37:14.670 --> 37:15.210
Zhaoyan,

37:16.320 --> 37:17.740
give me some time alone.

37:19.550 --> 37:20.010
Understood.

37:21.380 --> 37:27.860
♪Life hangs by the blade. What path is there for me to choose?♪

37:27.860 --> 37:30.740
[Grave of Beloved Daughter, Bai Hehuai]

37:34.180 --> 37:37.020
♪Rain drifts on steel at dusk♪

37:37.180 --> 37:41.300
♪Moon ripples below, road far ahead♪

37:41.420 --> 37:48.060
♪Dust rises, I walk toward the light♪

37:48.100 --> 37:55.020
♪Even alone through storm and snow♪

37:55.140 --> 38:01.780
♪I know spring dawn waits not far ahead♪

38:27.180 --> 38:29.900
♪Rain drifts on steel at dusk♪

38:30.020 --> 38:34.100
♪Moon ripples below, road far ahead♪

38:34.140 --> 38:40.860
♪Dust rises, I walk toward the light♪

38:40.940 --> 38:47.820
♪Even alone through storm and snow♪

38:47.900 --> 38:54.620
♪Even if the uproar still cannot be escaped♪

38:54.820 --> 39:02.620
♪It’s all to find the shore my heart has long sought♪
